### Day 10 Exercise 1 & 2 - API Versioning & Ticket Report Test Evidence
### Run the app first: mvn spring-boot:run
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080


### ============================================================
### Step 1: Login as a USER to obtain a token (expect 200 + token)
### Seeded credentials: testuser@example.com / Test@12345
### Copy the token value from the response body below
### ============================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "Test@12345"
}


### ============================================================
### Evidence 1: /api/v1/tickets rejects requests WITHOUT a token
### Expect: 401 Unauthorized
### ============================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tickets


### ============================================================
### Evidence 2: /api/v1/tickets works WITH a valid token
### Replace PASTE_USER_TOKEN_HERE with the token from Step 1
### Expect: 200 OK
### ============================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tickets
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_USER_TOKEN_HERE


### ============================================================
### Bonus: Create a ticket via the v1 route with a USER token
### Since v1 POST allows USER or ADMIN, this should succeed
### Replace PASTE_USER_TOKEN_HERE with the token from Step 1
### Expect: 201 Created
### ============================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tickets
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_USER_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "V1 API test ticket",
  "description": "Created through the new versioned endpoint.",
  "category": "Network",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "createdBy": "testuser@example.com"
}


### ============================================================
### Evidence 3: The old /api/tickets endpoint still works
### Replace PASTE_USER_TOKEN_HERE with the token from Step 1
### Expect: 200 OK (old endpoint is kept and still functional)
### ============================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_USER_TOKEN_HERE


### ============================================================
### Day 10 Exercise 2: Ticket Report by Status
### Returns a grouped count of tickets by status
### Replace PASTE_USER_TOKEN_HERE with the token from Step 1
### Expect: 200 OK with label/count array
### ============================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/tickets-by-status
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_USER_TOKEN_HERE


### ============================================================
### Day 10 Exercise 3: Ticket Report by Priority
### Returns a grouped count of tickets by priority (LOW, MEDIUM, HIGH)
### Replace PASTE_USER_TOKEN_HERE with the token from Step 1
### Expect: 200 OK with label/count array
### ============================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/tickets-by-priority
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_USER_TOKEN_HERE


### ============================================================
### Day 10 Exercise 4: API Documentation Endpoint
### Returns a JSON list of all API endpoints (public, no token needed)
### Expect: 200 OK
### ============================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/docs
